{"speciesId":574,"names":{"fr":"Scrutella","es":"Gothita","en":"Gothita","ja":"ゴチム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Concentre des pouvoirs psychiques dans ses antennes semblables à des rubans, et regarde fixement... mais quoi?"},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Fixe les Pokémon et les Dresseurs du regard comme s’il y avait quelque chose que personne d’autre ne pouvait voir."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It stares intently at everything. It can become so obsessed with watching that it doesn’t notice attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It stares intently at everything. It can become so obsessed with watching that it doesn’t notice attacks."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Concentre des pouvoirs psychiques dans ses antennes semblables à des rubans, et regarde fixement… mais quoi ?"},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Amplifica su poder psíquico con sus antenitas en forma de lazo. Siempre está mirando algo fijamente."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"リボンのような 触角で サイコパワーを 増幅させる。 なにかを じっと 見つめている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Fixe les Pokémon et les Dresseurs du regard comme s’il y avait quelque chose que personne d’autre ne pouvait voir."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Clava su mirada en Pokémon y Entrenadores como si observara algo solo perceptible por él."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ポケモンや トレーナーを じっと 観察する。ゴチムにしか 見えない なにかを 見つめているらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Concentre des pouvoirs psychiques dans ses antennes semblables à des rubans, et regarde fixement… mais quoi ?"},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Amplifica su poder psíquico con sus antenitas en forma de lazo. Siempre está mirando algo fijamente."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"リボンのような 触角で サイコパワーを 増幅させる。 なにかを じっと 見つめている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Fixe les Pokémon et les Dresseurs du regard comme s’il y avait quelque chose que personne d’autre ne pouvait voir."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Clava su mirada en Pokémon y Entrenadores como si observara algo solo perceptible por él."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ポケモンや トレーナーを じっと 観察する。ゴチムにしか 見えない なにかを 見つめているらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il n’est encore qu’un enfant, mais il lui arrive de se battre avec l’énergie psychique concentrée dans ses antennes en forme de rubans."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Pese a ser todavía un bebé, puede luchar con el poder psíquico que acumula en las antenitas en forma de lazos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Though they’re still only babies, there’s psychic power stored in their ribbonlike feelers, and sometimes they use that power to fight."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"まだまだ 赤ちゃん だけれど リボンに 似た 触角に 溜めた サイコパワーで 戦うこともある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Parfois, ce Pokémon chuchote alors qu’il n’y a personne aux alentours. On raconte qu’il parle à une entité que personne ne peut voir."}